  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Assignment is to produce a scoping/framing paper on Danish engagement with civil society organizations towards supporting their maturation into social movements. The scoping exercise should outline avenues, challenges and opportunities for engagement with social movements (in ODA countries).</narrative>
